# Delvers S1E10 — Fish Wizards!

**Source-identity follow-up, 2026-10-27:** The [S1E12–S1E08 batch check](../../reports/DELVERS_S1E12_S1E08_SOURCE_IDENTITY_2026-10-27.md#s1e10) verifies both complete local exports against their recorded Git blobs after CRLF-to-LF conversion only, and verifies both source paths in the recorded source commit. Raw bytes differ in line endings. This independently confirms local content correspondence with the originally pinned source revision. Earlier provenance statements remain dated history. Prior interpretive coverage, inter-ASR measurements, played cutoff and audio status are unchanged.

**Type and sequence:** Played *Delvers*, Season 1 Episode **S1E10 — Fish Wizards!**. Direct continuation of [S1E09](S1E09.md), not part of The Wastes or Inverse. Opening sponsor, edited/staged interrogation-style recap and closing broadcast discussion are **not independent in-world scenes**.

**Status (2026-10-25):** **ASR-provisional research**. Full processed Parakeet SRT reviewed chronologically from intro to network outro, ending **03:05:52.270**. Both complete Parakeet/Qwen Q8 SRTs parsed for an exact whole-source normalized ordered-word comparison; Qwen close-read **selected cross-check windows** for the mysterious wife's vision, guild rules, code, underwater passage, artifacts and final conversation, **not independently close-read throughout**. No original audio was listened to; MP3/SRT seek alignment was not verified, and encounter maps and historical character sheets were not inspected anew. [ASR report](../../reports/DELVERS_S1E10_ASR_COMPARISON_2026-10-25.md) · [Review queue](../REVIEW_QUEUE.md).

